\**{c=red:Note}**: This quest along with the quest {q:Chocobo's Wounds|Chocobo's Wounds|Chocobo's Wounds} (The {k:Chocobo license} quest) will activate upon speaking to {n:Brutus} for the first time.
=2 Walkthrough
* Head to {z:Upper Jeuno} and speak to {n:Brutus} at (G-7).
** Help the chocobo leave when prompted.
* Head to {z:La Theine Plateau} and check the Chocobo Tracks at the far northwest corner of (E-5), just south of the sliver of map in (E-4).
* Return to {z:Upper Jeuno} and speak to {n:Brutus} (G-7) again.
* Head to {z:Southern San d'Oria} and speak to {n:Hantileon} (I-11).
** You are given three choices to select.
** All choices are incorrect, but you must choose them anyway.
*** Select "Bring the chocobos together"
* Return to {n:Brutus} (G-7) in {z:Upper Jeuno} one last time to complete the quest.
* Speak to {n:Brutus} (G-7) after one game day to receive a chocobo egg.
** You must change zones and return to Upper Jeuno after the day change. Logging off and logging back on after the day changing without zoning will not trigger this cutscene, also.

\**Optional:** Trade the egg to one of the VCS Trainers located in {z:Bastok Mines}, {z:Southern San d'Oria}, or {z:Windurst Woods} to begin {p:raising a chocobo|Chocobo Raising}.
